name: ['Abzan Beastmaster', 'Anticipate', 'Disdainful Stroke', 'Frenzied Goblin', 'Frost Walker', 'Hordeling Outburst', 'Orator of Ojutai', 'Path to Exile', 'Roast', 'Serum Visions', 'Suspension Field', 'Ultimate Price']
